Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and make a stand The paint\Nwithin brings out a map of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,your own To
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the left and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the right all we saw stormy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,nights All the rough winds\Nand waves coming day after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,day And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see is\Nbeyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and toll,\Nwe'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.78,0:02:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all fix that kind of!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, Master, I'm ready Your\Nenemies shall taste my righteous fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hamlet has lost his damn mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, Master, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can pound the crap\Nout of who's who. Hey, poker!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Snowhack can\Nloosen us on his side!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second\Nfloor inside the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gipters are joining the Saga Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Tsunami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan worked out perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked every Gipter on\Nthe island to lend a paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we have a whole\Nzoo full of backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did save the\Nday, you know. Proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we beat those dumb lizards too! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that bread actually do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Muzama, look out! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You again, huh? Judge's\Nboy is back for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever say that\Nname in front of me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me how you know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you part of that mad scientist group?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean mads?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see real\Nscience? Take a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cyborg boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of figured without you\Nspelling it out, we are so dead clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is busting out his man beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come back, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look-a-here, a cyborg expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See what good it does you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, how's Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he's gonna pull through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, Change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you doing okay, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, very kind of you to ask,\Nmy boy, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tuckered out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This form is a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the Rumble Ball too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a drug we could\Nuse, but it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, at least let me heal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a medicine we mins have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyone can use it,\Nbut it comes from Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It heals even the most severe\Nwounds, and it does so rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,once a bit of time has passed, he'll\Nsuffer twice as much as he's suffering now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least, I can't make\Nthat choice while he's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me the drug already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, were listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to debate about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the drug so I can fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning this battle is the\Nonly thing that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what\Nhappens to my body later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go fight right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The headliners and the\Ngifters who went over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to the samurai army only number about 300,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but their power is considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only assume that\Nthe girl who got on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,stage at the performance\Nfloor is responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem to be following her, but we\Nhaven't been able to determine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that stunt, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how well your dirty tricks\Nwork on our men after we kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you medley little freak! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdering children now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scumbags give\Ndecent pirates a bad name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Otama! I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave you! I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up after I kick their butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Headliner coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Scorpion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Death needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison's already\Nflowing through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Difugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work on the\Noperation. Now hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sorcerina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been doing an\Nawful lot of running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come bearing news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But either way, it looks like\Nit's time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade System!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Arabesque Rift! Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is what you\Ncall Iron Body, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fighting style\Nused by government agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Six Powers, if I recall correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am reminded of a rumor I heard ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about an intelligence agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from Cape escaping from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's strange, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they send an\Nintelligence agent to prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny you'd remember\Nsuch a tiny little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But yes, your instincts are\Nright. That agent it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,me do you and i know each\Nother because i Can't seem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,to recall you at all i saw\Nyou once but you wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,have taken notice of me I\Nwas in Cape at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and you were one of the\Nseven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Life has taken us both in\Ndifferent directions since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a complaint, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite content with where I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I suffered\Na lot to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to one school of 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an extraordinary talent, as\Npromising as the brilliant Rob Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They said you're telling me this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't seem to have\Nanything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the six powers\Nused like that. But at any
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,rate as I told you your tragic\Npast has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I i disagree you're with Straw Hat aren't\Nyou you proudly proclaimed that you were
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a member of his crew anytime someone\Nmentions Straw Hats name it drags up some bad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,memories 13 years ago a Devil Fruit was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,stolen while it was being transported on a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,government ship then about two years back\Nwhen Straw Hat Luffy rose to prominence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I received quite the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That stolen item that\Ncaused me so much suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,was none other than Straw\NHat's Gum-Gum fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Komachiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'll pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Onami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Griselina, can you hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make our way to Komachiyo\Nand keep him safe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know it's dangerous out\Nthere, So you two be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have to make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you guys are my\Nfriends and I care about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She cares about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll serve our master well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way for the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That power of hers is\Nreally something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she can make friends anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And powerful ones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, since I'm here, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I be your assistant like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But how about partners?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of the Straw Hats! Cut them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with my partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She has him wrapped around her little\Nfinger already. Down with Kaido
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master needs our help. It's\Ntime to lead the Samurai to victory
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,About 2,000 of our\Nfighters have changed sides
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Another 2,000 were\Nblindsided by the betrayal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and have been defeated\Nby the enemy. putting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that in perspective the\Nbeast pirates initially
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,had 30,000 troops before losing 10,000 in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,battle these losses are\Nin addition to the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mentioned earlier so\Nwe've lost 14,000 total
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes it 16,000
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,versus 9000 if the gifters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,keep this up we'll see\Nmore white than black on
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The board, I don't care\Nwhich side comes out on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,top as long as our escaped\Nconvict is silenced for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,good and you're certain\Nit's him seems to be even
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,if that's the case the\Ninformation he possesses
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is old it poses no threat\Nto the government yes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have to set a\Nprecedent those who escape
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,our organization cannot\Nbe allowed to live well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the problem will likely\Ntake care of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He is fighting Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This might get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grudge is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Luffy have to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold a grudge with the man\Nwho stole the Gum-Gum fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,which is the pirate red-haired Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He caused me all that suffering and\Ndoesn't even have a clue! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fang Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain came here\Nwearing Shanks' Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shamed me by flaunting the powers\Nof the stolen Gum-Gum fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So of course he inherited my grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki can't block my attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's a smart decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those can chew through\Nargument. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see you move\Nso quickly on land. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fur fish me, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tired old racism?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were past that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, there's something\NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to suffer, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fragless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Jiu-Jitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tide silver throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Water shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, time out, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me a break\Nfor just one damn minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this story I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,heard when I was behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you know it as I\Nwas being tortured the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,guard mockingly told me\Nto pray for salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pray to the sun god Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a hero to slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a legendary warrior who\Nfought for freedom in ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prophesied to return and\Nliberate the enslaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he really\Nexisted but they say he would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,deliver folks from suffering\Nwith a smile on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a strange story but I held on\Nto it in those seemingly endless days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter who.\NJust save me. I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and what answers do you\Nhope to find from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor about some of\Nthe Sun Pirates you used to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a few of them used to be slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The history of fishmen\Nis a history of slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out the guard who told me\Nabout Nika was later executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they might come for me next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I risk everything to\Nget the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it dangerous to speak his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but be curious.\NWhat are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Toretti, sharp grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I really struck a nerve, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you, my pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate Secret Art! Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon's Brick Chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard your mouth about this\Nlike it's some sort of game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the weight of history!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
